## UML Activity Diagrams

UML activity diagrams for the four main BatchBite users.

**Figma:** [BatchBite Activity Diagrams](https://www.figma.com/design/1xuvAXyzIBoxj2FnZy8OOM/BatchBite-Activity-Diagrams)

### Diagrams

| # | Diagram | User | Process |
|---|---------|------|---------|
| 1 | Customer Activity Diagram | Customer | Place a preorder: browse, choose variant and quantity, pick a pickup time, confirm simulated payment |
| 2 | Business Owner Activity Diagram | Business Owner | Create a production batch: set product, deadline, max quantity and pickup date, then close ordering when the deadline or capacity is reached |
| 3 | Kitchen Staff Activity Diagram | Kitchen Staff | Process a customer order: Confirmed, Preparing, Ready, Collected |
| 4 | Administrator Activity Diagram | Administrator | Manage user accounts: edit account details or change user roles |

### Notation

- Solid circle: start
- Bullseye circle: end
- Rounded rectangle: action
- Diamond: decision (Yes / No branches)
